OL,3,AHome secretary scraps plan for migrant
OL,4,Acare workers already in UK to wait 15
OL,5,Ayears for settlement
OL,6,
OL,7,FShabana Mahmood scraps plans for
OL,8,Fmigrant care workers already in the UK
OL,9,Fto wait 15 years for permanent
OL,10,Fsettlement - here's what else we learnt
OL,12,FAs long as care workers earn at least
OL,13,F#25,000 and arrived in the UK before
OL,14,FMay 2025, they will be eligible for
OL,15,Findefinite leave to remain (ILR) after
OL,16,Ffive years
OL,18,FMahmood previously proposed extending
OL,19,Fthe wait time, in response to a period
OL,20,Fof high net migration, but faced some
OL,21,Fopposition from MPs in her own party
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
