OL,3,AHome secretary scraps plan for migrant
OL,4,Acare workers already in UK to wait 15
OL,5,Ayears for settlement
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the Commons, shadow home secretary
OL,8,FChris Philp describes the announcement
OL,9,Fas a "U-turn" and warned it could cost
OL,10,Ftaxpayers #10bn
OL,12,FIndefinite leave to remain (ILR), also
OL,13,Fknown as settlement, gives a person the
OL,14,Fright to live, work and study in the UK
OL,15,Ffor as long as they like and apply for
OL,16,Fbenefits if they are eligible
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
