OL,3,AProsecutors indicate plan to retry
OL,4,ALindsay Clancy for deaths of her three
OL,5,Achildren
OL,6,
OL,7,FLawyers on both sides argued about next
OL,8,Fsteps following the mistrial as the
OL,9,Fdefence argues the case should be
OL,10,Fdismissed entirely
OL,12,FThere were tense moments as the defence
OL,13,Fteam questioned how the judge handled
OL,14,Fthe single holdout juror and the judge
OL,15,Fthreatened to stop the hearing
OL,17,FClancy, 36, pleaded not guilty to
OL,18,Fmurdering Cora, 5, Dawson, 3, and
OL,19,FCallan, eight months, arguing she had
OL,20,Fpostpartum psychosis
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
